  "title": "This One Tool Makes Claude Code Way Cheaper to Run",
  "description": "Graphify is a free, open-source tool that turns any repository into a knowledge graph, so Claude Code (or any AI coding agent) answers questions about your repo using up to 71x fewer tokens. It works on codebases, docs, research papers, and plain markdown, like a lightweight retrieval system. Here's how to set it up. #Shorts #ClaudeCode #AICoding\n\nGet the full setup here: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1efNP85svaqidHpswyWHBjE9ZBtcZOnBu/edit?usp=sharing&ouid=110897400342351178452&rtpof=true&sd=true",
